QUERY NAME: Package2000Query
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: OTHER

SQL:
TRANSFORM Sum(tblTestRequ.NoTests) AS SumOfNoTests
SELECT Package2000.IDENTITY, Package2000.ANALYSIS_ID, TestOrProduct.ItemDescription
FROM (Package2000 INNER JOIN TestOrProduct ON Package2000.ANALYSIS_ID = TestOrProduct.ItemCode) INNER JOIN tblTestRequ ON TestOrProduct.ItemCode = tblTestRequ.TestCode
GROUP BY Package2000.IDENTITY, Package2000.ANALYSIS_ID, TestOrProduct.ItemDescription
PIVOT tblTestRequ.JobCode;

